# .dockerignore for the commit-image build.
# Goal: bake in the FULL repo (including .git history — the grader uses it),
# dropping only local build artifacts and editor/OS cruft. Dev image, not minimal.

# ── Build outputs / local cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# build.sh produces its outputs under /mayhem at build time. NOTE: do NOT exclude the
# subprojects/*.wrap files — meson needs them to fetch the c-util / Rust git-wrap deps at
# build time. (A `subprojects/libcdvar-*/` pattern would also eat `libcdvar-1.wrap`, breaking
# the build.) The meson-cloned subproject checkouts only exist after a local build; a clean CI
# checkout has just the .wrap files, so there's nothing extra to ignore here.
build/
mayhem-build/
mayhem-tests/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
**/__pycache__/

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
